---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import refs from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-01/references.json';
import v from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-01/verification.json';
const a='/equipment/06-01/';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Photonic Professional GT2 · Documentary exhibit" subtitle="" description="Inspect the closed GT2 cabinet and measure coordinates on a separate synthetic drawing." wide={true}>
<article class="equipment gt20601">
<nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/06-01/">← Equipment 06-01</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#evidence">Sources &amp; checks</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><span class="eq-meta">06-01 / Documentary reconstruction and passive ruler</span><h2>Nanoscribe Photonic Professional GT2 · Exterior &amp; ruler</h2><p>Orbit the closed floor-standing GT2 cabinet. On the separate coordinate drawing, measure between labeled marks and reverse their order to compare the signed components.</p></header>
<div class="dn-grid"><section class="dn-card"><h3>3D exhibit</h3>
<div class="dn-bar"><button data-view="whole">Whole exhibit</button><button data-view="front">Cabinet front</button><button data-view="side">Cabinet side</button><button data-view="chart">Ruler plaque</button><button id="camera-reset">Reset view</button></div>
<div class="dn-camera"><canvas id="gt2-model" aria-label="Closed floor-standing GT2 with a separate digital drawing plaque"></canvas></div>
<p id="asset" class="dn-note" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="dn-note">Drag or pinch to inspect. The warm plaque key cycles mark pairs; the pale blue key reverses their order. The cabinet has no interactive controls or opening panels.</p></section>
<section class="dn-card"><h3>Measure the drawing</h3><div class="dn-bar"><label>Marks <select id="pair"><option value="AB">A and B</option><option value="AC">A and C</option><option value="AA">A and A</option></select></label><button class="primary" id="reverse">Reverse direction</button><button id="reset">Reset marks</button></div>
<canvas id="ruler" width="426" height="286" role="img" aria-label="Synthetic X and Y illustration, showing mark positions and a line between chosen marks"></canvas>
<p class="dn-note" id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">A → B: 50 µm. ΔX +30 µm, ΔY +40 µm.</p>
<div class="dn-bar"><button id="json">Export ruler JSON</button><a href={a+'example-ruler.json'}>Example reading</a></div>
<p class="dn-note">The drawing uses a 5 µm grid. Subtract the start point from the end point and take the Euclidean length. This readout is not GT2 resolution, calibration, or measurement of a specimen.</p></section></div>
<section id="evidence"><h3>Sources and geometric verification</h3>
<figure class="dn-fig"><img src={a+'reference-elevation.svg'} alt="Original GT2 cabinet outline beside an enlarged right triangle on a separate plaque" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original diagram drawn from documented GT2 photos. The detached right triangle is invented and enlarged for display.</figcaption></figure>
<ul>{refs.references.map(r=><li><a href={r.url}>{r.title}</a>. {r.caption}</li>)}</ul>
<p>The GT2 outline follows the OEM photograph. Its metre-scale GLB uses an approximate <b>900 × 900 × 1420 mm</b> (W × D × H) proxy from the predecessor GT to establish overall scale. That is not an OEM dimension for this GT2. Unverified enclosure proportions, housing seams, rear details and separate plaque are not installation data. No optics, printing, sample handling, or material behavior are simulated.</p>
<div class="dn-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Tolerance</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>{v.checks.map(c=><tr><th scope="row">{c.id}</th><td>{String(c.expected)} {c.unit}</td><td>{typeof c.actual==='number'?Number(c.actual.toFixed(8)):String(c.actual)} {c.unit}</td><td>{c.tolerance===0?'Exact':c.tolerance}</td><td>{c.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'build-model.py'} download>Editable model</a> · <a href={a+'gt2-documentary.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'references.json'}>Reference notes</a> · <a href={a+'vr-station.json'}>VR action manifest</a> · <a href={a+'ruler.mjs'}>Geometry module</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification JSON</a>. No headset session tested.</p>
</section></article></Layout><script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/06-01/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
.gt20601{--dn-rule:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 26%,transparent);max-width:1280px;margin:auto}.dn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}.dn-card{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.85rem;margin:.8rem 0}.dn-card h3{margin:.21rem 0 .6rem}.dn-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin:.53rem 0}.dn-bar,.dn-note,.dn-fig figcaption{font:.89rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}
.gt20601 :is(button,select){font:inherit;padding:.4rem;background:var(--panel,Canvas);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--dn-rule);border-radius:3px;min-height:38px;cursor:pointer}.gt20601 .primary{background:#34594f;color:#fff}.dn-camera{aspect-ratio:1.34;background:#263b40}.dn-camera canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}.gt20601 #ruler{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:492px;margin:.6rem 0}.dn-table{overflow:auto}.dn-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.dn-table :is(td,th){border-bottom:1px solid var(--dn-rule);padding:.42rem;text-align:left}.dn-fig{margin:1rem 0;max-width:680px}.dn-fig img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.dn-fig figcaption{margin:.38rem 0}@media(max-width:850px){.dn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
